edits.tool_guide:
Reply with exactly one JSON object per turn, and nothing else:
{
  "tool": "list_tables"
}                     list the tables
{
  "tool": "describe", "arg": "TABLE"
}        show a table's columns and keys
{
  "tool": "run_sql", "arg": "SELECT ..."
}    run a query and see its first rows
{
  "tool": "submit", "arg": "SELECT ..."
}     give your final answer (ends the task)

Make sure to use table descriptions to verify column names before using them in queries.

